如何在宏指令中使用内部存储区
在HMIStudio组态软件中提供了HMI内部存储区的操作接口，用户可以在宏指令中直接对内部存储区操作，具体方法有2种：
1.通过关键字访问内部存储区
LocalBit:内部存储区LB的引用；
LocalWord：内部存储区LW的引用；
RWIWord：内部存储区RWI的引用。
在宏指令代码中可以直接使用该关键字，如：
if(LocalBit[5])
{
LocalWord[1]=0;
}else
{
LocalWord[1]=1;
}
2.通过变量设定，建立一个变量与内部存储区关联,具体使用方法见宏指令实例。

Troubleshooting USB download problems:
(i): First determine if the download cable matches:
1: When using Micro USB cable or TYPE-C cable to download the program from the computer, the USB download mode should be switched to "Auto Mode", at this time, Micro or TYPE-C is for USB download, and TYPE-A is for USB flash drive download (factory default status);
2: When using TYPE-A USB cable to download the program from the computer, the USB download mode should be switched to "Manual Mode" ---- "USB Download";
3: When using a USB flash drive to download the program, only the TYPE-A interface can be used;
4: A single USB output interface model, the factory default "USB download mode", unless the customer special requirements;
(ii): The computer does not recognize the USB or the upgrade fails midway:
1: Our USB driver is not installed correctly, or the installation of the USB driver is abnormal;
2: Other devices EMI electromagnetic interference caused by USB download abnormalities, you can turn off other devices, such as nearby servo motors, inverters, controllers, computer displays and so on;
3: HMI download mode is different, such as set in "U disk mode" and use USB cable to download;
4: USB signal cable is too long or after HUB adapter, can be changed to connect directly to the computer USB;
5: Two or more USB cables are connected to the HMI host side at the same time, resulting in an abnormal USB differential signal, disconnect the free USB connection (please be sure to disconnect the HMI host side);
6: Computer USB port abnormal, replace other computers;
7: common mode interference caused by power supply, 24V power input positive and negative series connection "common mode inductor" to suppress common mode interference;
8: Input power supply power is small, please match the appropriate power supply according to the parameters of our label sticker;
9: Communication signals interfere with USB differential signals, disconnect the communication connection cable;
10: Multiple devices connected to the grounding line interference, using a separate power supply;
11: The USB cable is abnormal;
12: Use a USB flash drive or SD card to upgrade emergency treatment;
13: HMI host damage, return to our Division after-sales processing;

About not power on abnormal troubleshooting as follows:
1: The input power supply voltage is low or high, please check the input reference voltage of each model of our company;
2: The power supply power is small, please check the maximum power of each model of our company, and add appropriate margin, (power supply power is best to increase 1 times the margin or more);
3: Whether the positive and negative poles are reversed;
4: Whether the power input connector is in good contact;
5: Check the power supply current is large or small, such as the current is too large to rule out high voltage, small time to check whether the power supply power is too small;
6: After upgrading the software can not boot, if the upgrade of the wrong base layer leads to a black screen, you need to re-upgrade the correct base layer to solve the problem;
7: HMI host damage, back to our Division after-sales processing.
8: LCD screen is damaged, no display.

The methods for troubleshooting communication anomalies are as follows：
1: RS232 communication ground is not connected;
2: RS232 TX needs to be connected to RX of the controller, RX to TX of the controller;
3: RS232 communication cable is too long, (more than 15 meters);
4: The RS485 A B connection line corresponds to the A B line of the controller, no need to cross-connect;
5: Add or remove 120R termination resistor between RS485 A B lines;
6: The RS485 communication line is too long or distributed with other power lines to cause interference;
7: RS485 communication abnormality, RS485 communication method is not set in configuration software;
8: T0+ T0- for RS422 communication needs to be connected to R0+ R0- of the controller respectively, and R0+ R0- to T0+ T0- of the controller respectively;
9: RS422 communication is abnormal, the configuration software is not set in RS422 communication mode;
10: EMI electromagnetic interference, cut off the power supply of other interfering equipment in the neighborhood;
11: HMI and controller or PLC communication methods are different;
12: HMI host damage, return to our Division after-sales processing.

About no touch abnormal troubleshooting as follows:
1: boot always pop-up system setup interface, installation of HMI screws too tight, resulting in HMI and other structural components have interference, general installation of the snap screws can be solved by loosening;
2: the environment temperature is too high or too low leading to HMI thermal expansion and contraction, can be suitable for cooling or heating test;
3: touch drift: touch position bias, long press the HMI and then power on the boot into the "setup interface", recalibrate!
